# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day21

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| decline | 감소하다, 쇠퇴하다 | The population began to decline. |
| expand | 확대하다 | The city continues to expand. |
| maintain | 유지하다 | The species maintains a stable population. |

---

## Synonyms

### decline
→ decrease / diminish

### expand
→ increase / enlarge

### maintain
→ preserve / sustain

---

## Useful Collocations

population decline
→ 인구 감소

expand rapidly
→ 빠르게 확대되다

maintain stability
→ 안정성을 유지하다

